            <fragment start="OPS/Kapu_9780375413452_epub_c02_r1.htm#point(/1/2/1/36/1:203)" end="OPS/Kapu_9780375413452_epub_c02_r1.htm#point(/1/2/1/37:0)" progress="0.0644068" color="4">
                <text>Rather than a material or territorial community, it is a spiritual community that binds the African to those closest to him.</text>
