                <text>One can tell from afar that a chief is coming—because of the open umbrella. A great chief has an enormous, decorative umbrella, held by a special servant; a lesser chief walks about with an ordinary umbrella purchased from an Arab in the marketplace. “</text>
            </fragment>
        </target>
    </annotation>
    <annotation>
